From 0ca0d482c82e71b681d6b1b50b7642a9218a1982 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tunkoal <tunkoal@163.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:10:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] LiveDisplay: Read back color profiles asynchronously

Serialize display service work off the UI thread and ignore stale lifecycle callbacks. Update selection from current service state, confirm persistent changes by readback, and expose retry after unavailable reads. Keep saved defaults distinct from an observed active mode.

Source, resource XML and diff checks only. Compilation and lifecycle/service recovery testing are deferred to the combined candidate.

Change-Id: I43c89ac7163f5a9291453fe080396b2f8f8e22fb
---
